OL,3,GNEWSASickle cell patient's pain
OL,4,A'ridiculed' in hospital, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a 32-year-old mother said
OL,7,Fshe faced "ridicule" from hospital
OL,8,Fstaff when she sought urgent care for
OL,9,Fpain caused by sickle cell disease, an
OL,10,Finquest has heard.
OL,12,FVeronique Mwembo had lived with the
OL,13,Fgenetic disease all her life and was
OL,14,Fbeing treated at the Norfolk and
OL,15,FNorwich University Hospital (NNUH) for
OL,16,Fbacterial infections, area coroner
OL,17,FYvonne Blake said.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
