OL,3,GNEWSASickle cell patient's pain
OL,4,A'ridiculed' in hospital, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of one, who lived in
OL,7,FNorwich, had administered medication to
OL,8,Fherself incorrectly, leading to a
OL,9,Fcardiac arrest which resulted in her
OL,10,Fdeath on 23 January.
OL,12,FAt an inquest into her death, her
OL,13,Ffamily said her mental health
OL,14,Fdeteriorated after she had said she
OL,15,Frepeatedly felt dismissed by staff
OL,16,Fabout her pain.
